        <mxCell id="card_c1_apple" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #E11D48;&quot;&gt;📱 Apple Health &amp;amp; Scales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px; background: #FFE4E6; color: #BE123C; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;DAILY SYNC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;Lifestyle, Sleep Stages &amp;amp; Body Weight&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11.5px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.55;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Sleep Architecture:&lt;/b&gt; Deep, Core, REM &amp;amp; awake time (7.0h avg)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Body Weight Trajectory:&lt;/b&gt; 79.7 kg live vs. 85.0 kg target&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Resting Heart Rate:&lt;/b&gt; 56.8 bpm baseline stability&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Walking &amp;amp; Mobility:&lt;/b&gt; Daily ambient steps &amp;amp; recovery&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
