        <mxCell id="card_c1_wod" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #D97706;&quot;&gt;🏋️ CrossFit &amp;amp; Gym Notes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px; background: #FEF3C7; color: #B45309; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;STRUCTURED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;Conditioning WODs &amp;amp; Training Details&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11.5px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.55;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;METCON Formats:&lt;/b&gt; AMRAP, For Time, EMOM, Chipper&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Movement Splits:&lt;/b&gt; Ergs, thrusters, pull-ups, carries&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Athlete Perceived Effort:&lt;/b&gt; Subjective RPE &amp;amp; fatigue context&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Coach Session Notes:&lt;/b&gt; Focus cues &amp;amp; scaling variations&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
