        <mxCell id="card_c2_recov" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #9333EA;&quot;&gt;🌙 Recovery &amp;amp; HRV Balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px; background: #F3E8FF; color: #7E22CE; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;AUTONOMIC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;Sports Science: Plews &amp;amp; Buchheit Vagal Model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11.5px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.55;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;28-Day Garmin HRV Baseline:&lt;/b&gt; Individualized normal corridor&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Smallest Worthwhile Change (SWC):&lt;/b&gt; Flags true physiological strain&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;7-Day Rolling Sleep Debt:&lt;/b&gt; Deficit vs. 8h target (5.2h tracked)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Pre-Symptom Warning:&lt;/b&gt; Spots central fatigue days before injury&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
