        <mxCell id="card_c2_str" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #7C3AED;&quot;&gt;💪 Strength &amp;amp; Fatigue Engine&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px; background: #EDE9FE; color: #6D28D9; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;LOAD GUARD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;Brzycki 1RM Modeling &amp;amp; ACWR Sweet Spot&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11.5px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.55;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Estimated 1RM (e1RM):&lt;/b&gt; Progression on Bench, Squat, Deadlift&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Safe Workload Ratio (ACWR = 0.84):&lt;/b&gt; Optimal injury-safe zone&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;1513 Audited Sets &amp;amp; 597 Tons:&lt;/b&gt; Zero missing rep estimations&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Targeted Muscle Mapping:&lt;/b&gt; Maps lifts directly to anatomical groups&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
