        <mxCell id="card_c2_dur" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #6366F1;&quot;&gt;⚡ Conditioning &amp;amp; Durability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px; background: #E0E7FF; color: #4338CA; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;ENDURANCE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;Hyperbolic Critical Speed &amp;amp; METCON Retention&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11.5px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.55;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Critical Speed (CS = 5:09/km):&lt;/b&gt; Sustainable aerobic ceiling&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Anaerobic Battery (D' = 62.9m):&lt;/b&gt; High-intensity sprint reserve&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;CrossFit Durability Index (87.5%):&lt;/b&gt; Pace retention across rounds&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Engine Benchmark:&lt;/b&gt; Calibrated pacing targets for competition&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
