        <mxCell id="card_c3_today" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #059669;&quot;&gt;🎯 &quot;Today&quot; Command Center&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px; background: #D1FAE5; color: #047857; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;&quot;&gt;DAILY BRIEF&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11px; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;Single Unified View for the Morning Routine&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 11.5px; color: #334155; line-height: 1.55;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Composite Readiness Score:&lt;/b&gt; 96.9% Optimal green badge&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Today's Prescribed Workout:&lt;/b&gt; Target movements, sets &amp;amp; pace&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;AI Decision Log:&lt;/b&gt; Exact physiological reasons behind advice&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Immediate Alerts:&lt;/b&gt; Flags if training load spikes unsafely&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=12;fontFamily=Inter,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1">
